@startuml dashboard-update
skinparam shadowing false

actor Maintainer
participant "GitHub Actions\n(push to main, schedule)" as actions
participant "cumin-trace" as ct
participant "GitHub API" as gh
participant "Starlight build" as build
database "static site" as site

actions -> ct : trace
ct -> gh : read the requirement issues,\nsub-issues, pull requests (read only)
gh --> ct
ct --> actions : trace result,\nwith the time of the read
actions -> build : build
build -> site : documents + dashboard
Maintainer -> site : open the dashboard

note over Maintainer, ct
  On the own machine, one command does the same
  and starts the preview.
end note
@enduml
